(2931, 0, '2018-05-31 16:34:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '<a href=\"http://rxhurry.com\">Tramadol</a>, marketed as Ultram, is a pain treatment medication providing relief from mild to severe pain. Its immediate-release form – tablet taken orally – can come into effect within one hour of intake. \r\nAs with any other medication, <a href=\"http://rxhurry.com\">Tramadol</a> should be taken under guidance and with precaution to avoid serious side effects. For instance, do not combine Tramadol with alcohol, do not crush a Tramdadol tablet to consume it, etc. Side effects can include drowsiness, fatigue, upset digestion, etc., in which case medical assistance should be sought. - more on the website <a href=\"http://rxhurry.com\">rxhurry.com</a>', 'Tramadol', '', 'pending', 'closed', 'closed', '', '', '', '', '2018-05-31 16:34:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', 0, 'https://kraftman.ru/?p=2931', 0, 'feedback_new', '', 0),
